<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="PreWash-Cell 시스템 아키텍처" id="prewash-arch"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" page="1" pageWidth="4533" pageHeight="2862" background="#ffffff"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;PreWash-Cell 시스템 아키텍처 — PC 2대 · 우리가 만든 프로그램 2개(flow_node · hmi_bridge)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=33.3;whiteSpace=nowrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="16.0" width="1421.6" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle" value="코드 기준 main 0e35e3a · 글자가 작으니 원본 크기로 열어 확대해서 봄" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16.7;fontColor=#555555;whiteSpace=nowrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1465.6" y="28.0" width="512.2" height="24.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b7c1cc;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="60.0" width="4473.0" height="349.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg1t" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;① 화살표 색 = 데이터 갈래&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=18.1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50.0" y="72.0" width="214.7" height="26.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg1e0" style="endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#1f4fd6;strokeWidth=3.0;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="60.0" y="122.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="140.0" y="122.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="leg1l0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;명령 · 요청 — 브라우저의 HTTP 요청 전부(버튼 POST · 조회 GET · 페이지) → hmi_bridge → /flow/start · stop · resume · abort&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="154.0" y="110.0" width="869.0" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg1e1" style="endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#9c27b0;strokeWidth=3.0;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="60.0" y="153.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="140.0" y="153.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="leg1l1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;상태 표시 — /flow/state · event · weigh → hmi_bridge → 브라우저(WebSocket · HTTP 답)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="154.0" y="141.0" width="631.4" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg1e2" style="endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=3.0;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="60.0" y="184.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="140.0" y="184.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="leg1l2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;로봇 — flow_node → 두산 드라이버(이동 · 힘 제어 · 상태 읽기 · 일시정지 / 재개 / 정지) → 제어기&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="154.0" y="172.0" width="642.6" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg1e3" style="endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#2e9d2e;strokeWidth=3.0;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="60.0" y="215.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="140.0" y="215.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="leg1l3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;그리퍼 — /onrobot/sendCommand · /onrobot_joint_states · RG2 그리퍼&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="154.0" y="203.0" width="517.6" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg1e4" style="endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#e08a00;strokeWidth=2.8;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="60.0" y="246.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="140.0" y="246.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="leg1l4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;설정 · 기록 — cell.yaml · params.yaml 읽기 · records.csv · prewash.db&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="154.0" y="234.0" width="505.1" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg1e5" style="endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#00acc1;strokeWidth=2.8;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="60.0" y="277.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="140.0" y="277.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="leg1l5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;탐색 — 두 PC 의 ROS 노드(우리 프로그램 · 두산 · RG2 드라이버)가 로봇 PC 의 Discovery Server 에 붙어 서로를 찾음&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="154.0" y="265.0" width="763.8" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg1e6" style="endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;strokeWidth=2.2;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="60.0" y="308.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="140.0" y="308.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="leg1l6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;코드 불러 쓰기(import) — 같은 프로세스 안 · 통신 아님&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="154.0" y="296.0" width="367.1" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg2t" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;② 선 모양&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=18.1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1293.3" y="72.0" width="92.1" height="26.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg2s0" style="endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2.6;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1303.3" y="122.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1393.3" y="122.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="leg2l0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;실선 = 지금 쓰는 연결(코드 · 설치 · 배선 — main 0e35e3a 기준)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1409.3" y="110.0" width="780.0" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg2v1" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2.4;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1348.3" y="147.8" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1348.3" y="173.8" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="leg2h1" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#1f4fd6;strokeWidth=2.4;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=14;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1303.3" y="160.8" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1393.3" y="160.8" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="leg2l1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;다리 = 선이 엇갈리기만 하는 곳(서로 이어진 게 아님) — 카드 안 선도 같음&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1409.3" y="148.8" width="780.0" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg2d2a" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#9c27b0;strokeWidth=2.0;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1303.3" y="193.5" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1393.3" y="193.5" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="leg2d2b" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#9c27b0;strokeWidth=2.0;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1348.3" y="193.5" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1348.3" y="211.5" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="leg2d2c" value="" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#9c27b0;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1344.1" y="189.3" width="8.4" height="8.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg2l2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;점 = 선이 합쳐지거나 갈라지는 곳(같은 출발 또는 같은 도착)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1409.3" y="187.5" width="780.0" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg2i3" style="endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;html=1;strokeColor=#2e9d2e;strokeWidth=1.3;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1303.3" y="232.2" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1393.3" y="244.2" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1343.3" y="232.2"/><mxPoint x="1343.3" y="244.2"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="leg2l3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;카드 안 가는 선 = 입력이 어느 처리로 가고, 어느 처리가 출력을 냄(색 = 바깥 화살표 색 · 회색 = 처리끼리)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1409.3" y="226.2" width="780.0" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg2l4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;서비스 · 장치 화살표는 부르는 쪽 → 받는 쪽 한 방향만. 답은 같은 길로 돌아옴&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1409.3" y="265.0" width="780.0" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg2l5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;구독은 있지만 실제 운전에서 발행하는 노드가 없는 토픽(/cell/force · /cell/gripping — 개발용 fake_state_pub 만&lt;br&gt;냄)은 선으로 안 그림&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1409.3" y="303.8" width="780.0" height="42.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg3t" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;③ 상자 종류&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=18.1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2455.6" y="72.0" width="108.7" height="26.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg3b0" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6b7785;strokeWidth=1.8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2465.6" y="114.0" width="70.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg3h0" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dde6f7;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2466.6" y="115.0" width="68.0" height="7.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg3l0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;프로그램 카드 — 우리가 만든 ROS 2 프로그램 하나(안에 노드 1~2개 · 머리띠 색 = 도는 PC)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2547.6" y="113.0" width="588.8" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg3b1" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d6dbe2;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2465.6" y="145.0" width="70.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg3l1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;이미 있는 노드 · 프로그램 — 설치해서 씀&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2547.6" y="144.0" width="273.0" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg3b2" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3f0ff;strokeColor=#7e6bb0;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2465.6" y="176.0" width="70.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg3l2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;라이브러리 — 노드 아님 · import 해서 씀&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2547.6" y="175.0" width="279.6" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg3b3" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eaf3ff;strokeColor=#4a78b0;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2465.6" y="207.0" width="70.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg3l3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;저장소 — 설정 파일 · 기록 파일 · DB&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2547.6" y="206.0" width="249.3" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg3b4" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2465.6" y="238.0" width="70.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg3l4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;장치 — 하드웨어 · 브라우저&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2547.6" y="237.0" width="192.5" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg3b5" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f7f9fc;strokeColor=#8a96a3;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2465.6" y="269.0" width="70.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg3l5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;실행 방법 글 상자&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2547.6" y="268.0" width="124.7" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg3b6" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2465.6" y="300.0" width="70.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg3g6" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2472.6" y="309.0" width="56.0" height="10.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg3l6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;처리 묶음 — 카드 안에서 처리 상자를 묶음(스레드 · 시작 단계)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2547.6" y="299.0" width="406.1" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4t" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;④ 낱말&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=18.1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3406.8" y="72.0" width="71.4" height="26.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4k0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;노드&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3416.8" y="112.0" width="44.1" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4v0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;ROS 2 통신에 이름을 걸고 참여하는 단위. 한 프로그램이 여러 개를 만들 수 있음(flow_node 프로그램 = flow_node + flow_node_dsr)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3596.8" y="112.0" width="870.2" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4k1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;토픽&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3416.8" y="143.0" width="44.1" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4v1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;방송 — 보내고 끝, 답 없음. 상태 · 이벤트 · 무게처럼 계속 흐르는 값&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3596.8" y="143.0" width="437.1" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4k2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;서비스&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3416.8" y="174.0" width="58.2" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4v2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;부탁 → 답 한 번. 버튼(시작 · 일시정지 · 재개 · 중단) · 로봇 이동 · 그리퍼 명령&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3596.8" y="174.0" width="512.3" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4k3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;스레드&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3416.8" y="205.0" width="58.2" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4v3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;한 프로그램 안에서 동시에 도는 일꾼. flow_node = 메인(로봇 순서) + cc_io(통신) + cc_signal(Ctrl+C 감시) + 닦기 쪽(F3) 이동 중 툴 폭 감시&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3596.8" y="205.0" width="902.2" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4k4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;라이브러리&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3416.8" y="236.0" width="86.3" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4v4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;노드가 아니라 노드 안에서 import 해 쓰는 코드 묶음&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3596.8" y="236.0" width="345.2" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4k5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;Discovery Server&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3416.8" y="267.0" width="142.3" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4v5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;두 PC 의 ROS 노드가 서로를 찾게 돕는 안내소(Fast DDS). 강의실 무선이 자동 찾기를 막아서 씀&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3596.8" y="267.0" width="612.3" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4k6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;넛지&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3416.8" y="298.0" width="44.1" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4v6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;사람이 로봇 팔을 가볍게 밀어(15 N · 0.15 s) 멈춤을 푸는 신호. 툴 힘으로 알아챔&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3596.8" y="298.0" width="517.3" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4k7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;REST · WebSocket&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3416.8" y="329.0" width="154.3" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4v7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;REST = HTTP 부탁 1번 · 답 1번 / WebSocket = 연결을 열어 둔 채 서버가 바로 밀어 줌&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3596.8" y="329.0" width="562.6" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4k8" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;가짜 기능(mock)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3416.8" y="360.0" width="128.8" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg4v8" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;로봇 없이 같은 이름 · 인자로 바로 결과를 주는 함수. 화면 · 순서 시험용&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=15.3;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3596.8" y="360.0" width="461.4" height="23.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="band_hmi" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fbf3ea;strokeColor=#b36b00;strokeWidth=3.2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="443.0" width="2677.0" height="867.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="band_hmi_t" value="&lt;b&gt;웹 PC — 무선 · ROS 2 Jazzy&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#b36b00;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=19.4;align=left;spacingLeft=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="443.0" width="280.7" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="band_gpu" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef1fb;strokeColor=#3b5bb5;strokeWidth=3.2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="1396.3" width="2677.0" height="1102.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="band_gpu_t" value="&lt;b&gt;로봇 PC — 로봇과 유선 · ROS 2 Jazzy&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#3b5bb5;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=19.4;align=left;spacingLeft=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="1396.3" width="356.7" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="band_cell" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ecf6f0;strokeColor=#2e8b7a;strokeWidth=3.2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="2553.1" width="2677.0" height="169.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="band_cell_t" value="&lt;b&gt;로봇 셀 장치&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#2e8b7a;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=19.4;align=left;spacingLeft=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="2553.1" width="134.3" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="browser" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[장치] 브라우저 — 운영자가 보는 웹 화면&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px;font-size:13.2px;color:#3a3a3a&quot;&gt;같은 웹 PC 에서 포트 8000 으로 염 · Next.js 15 정적 빌드(web/out) +&lt;br&gt;React 19 — 페이지 파일은 hmi_bridge 가 서빙(Node 서버 없음) · 버튼&lt;br&gt;시작 · 일시 정지 · 재개 · 중단 · 교체 완료 · 단계 그림 · 실시간 무게 ·&lt;br&gt;팔레트 · 소모품 · KPI · 이력 · WebSocket 이 끊기면 2 s 뒤 다시 붙고&lt;br&gt;그동안 GET /api/state 0.5 s · DB 값은 15 s 마다 GET&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=15.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2094.0" y="621.1" width="440.0" height="134.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="db" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[저장소] prewash.db — SQLite 표 5개&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px;font-size:13.2px;color:#3a3a3a&quot;&gt;events · runs · pauses · commands · replacements · 워크스페이스&lt;br&gt;루트 · 칸 · 관계는 오른쪽 DB ERD&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#eaf3ff;strokeColor=#4a78b0;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=15.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2094.0" y="777.5" width="440.0" height="75.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cfg_hmi" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[저장소] 설정 파일 cell.yaml · params.yaml — 웹 PC&lt;br&gt;사본&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px;font-size:13.2px;color:#3a3a3a&quot;&gt;두 PC 가 각자 같은 워크스페이스를 빌드해 읽음 — hmi_bridge 가&lt;br&gt;cobot_common.config(설정 읽기) · cobot_msgs(메시지 3개)를&lt;br&gt;import 하므로 웹 PC 에도 빌드가 필요함 · hmi_bridge 는 hmi 절 ·&lt;br&gt;flow.plan · rack_order · consumables · policy ·&lt;br&gt;f2.leftover_threshold_g 50 · weigh_samples 30 을 씀&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#eaf3ff;strokeColor=#4a78b0;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=15.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="72.0" y="747.1" width="400.0" height="143.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="disc" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[이미 있는 프로그램 · ROS 노드 아님] Fast DDS Discovery Server&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px;font-size:13.2px;color:#3a3a3a&quot;&gt;로봇 PC 터미널 A 에서 fastdds discovery --server-id 0(포트 11811) · 끝까지 켜&lt;br&gt;둠 · 두 PC 의 ROS 터미널(로봇 PC 브링업 B · 메인 C · 웹 PC 화면 서버):&lt;br&gt;RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_fastrtps_cpp · ROS_DISCOVERY_SERVER ·&lt;br&gt;ROS_SUPER_CLIENT=TRUE · ROS_DOMAIN_ID=60 · 강의실 무선이 자동&lt;br&gt;찾기(멀티캐스트)를 막아서 씀 · 무선이 끊기면 화면만 끊기고 로봇은 계속 돎(멈추는&lt;br&gt;수단은 E-Stop)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#d6dbe2;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=15.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="72.0" y="1610.2" width="480.0" height="141.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cfg_gpu" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[저장소] 설정 파일 cell.yaml · params.yaml&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px;font-size:13.2px;color:#3a3a3a&quot;&gt;src/cobot_common/config · cell.yaml = 한계(속도 · 안전 높이 · 힘 · 넛지) ·&lt;br&gt;이동 · 힘 공용 값 · 파지 프리셋 · 스테이션 · 반납 구역 · 배드 · 랙 좌표(툴 · TCP 는&lt;br&gt;값이 아니라 Dart 에 등록 — 머리말 주석에 이름 · 값만) · params.yaml = f1 · f2 ·&lt;br&gt;f3 · flow · hmi 절 · 찾는 순서 PREWASH_CONFIG_DIR → 설치 share → 소스&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#eaf3ff;strokeColor=#4a78b0;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=15.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="72.0" y="1769.3" width="480.0" height="108.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cobot_common" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[라이브러리] cobot_common — 공용 로봇 함수&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px;font-size:13.2px;color:#3a3a3a&quot;&gt;두산 API(DR_init · DSR_ROBOT2)와 그리퍼를 감싼 cc.* — init · shutdown ·&lt;br&gt;move_to · move_rel · pause · resume · halt · grip · release ·&lt;br&gt;grip_width · weigh · force_on / off · safe_retreat · read_force ·&lt;br&gt;check_nudge · config.load() · DSR_ROBOT2 는 여기서만 import&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#f3f0ff;strokeColor=#7e6bb0;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=15.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="72.0" y="1895.3" width="480.0" height="108.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cobot_api" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[라이브러리] cobot_api — 기능 함수 13개 약속&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px;font-size:13.2px;color:#3a3a3a&quot;&gt;F1Api pick · regrip_top · place · move_to · tool · rack_place / F2Api&lt;br&gt;weigh · leftover_loop · shake · dip / F3Api soap · wipe_bowl · wipe_cup ·&lt;br&gt;Result · 실패 코드 15개 · check_api · 로봇 코드 없음&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#f3f0ff;strokeColor=#7e6bb0;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=15.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="72.0" y="2021.4" width="480.0" height="91.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="real" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[라이브러리] 기능 함수 — 진짜&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px;font-size:13.2px;color:#3a3a3a&quot;&gt;f1_handling.handling(F1 6개) · f2_sense_flow.sense(F2 4개) ·&lt;br&gt;f3_wipe.wipe(F3 3개) — cobot_common 으로 로봇을 움직임&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#f3f0ff;strokeColor=#7e6bb0;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=15.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="72.0" y="2131.0" width="480.0" height="75.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mock" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[라이브러리] 가짜 기능 — 로봇 없이 실행(use_mock)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px;font-size:13.2px;color:#3a3a3a&quot;&gt;f2_sense_flow.mock.mock_f1 · mock_f2 · mock_f3 — 같은 이름 · 인자 ·&lt;br&gt;로봇을 안 움직이고 바로 Result · 실패 주입 flow.mock.fail_on&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#f3f0ff;strokeColor=#7e6bb0;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=15.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="72.0" y="2224.1" width="480.0" height="75.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="dsr" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[이미 있는 노드] 두산 드라이버 — dsr_controller2 (ns /dsr01)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px;font-size:13.2px;color:#3a3a3a&quot;&gt;m0609_rg2_bringup bringup.launch.py 로 띄움(설치한 배포본 · 우리가&lt;br&gt;만들지 않음) · flow_node 가 부르는 서비스 갈래: 이동(motion) · 힘&lt;br&gt;제어(force) · 상태 읽기(aux_control · system) · 툴 / TCP 이름(tool ·&lt;br&gt;tcp) · 일시정지 / 재개 / 정지(motion/move_pause · move_resume ·&lt;br&gt;move_stop) · 제어기와는 두산 전용 TCP 포트 12345(DDS 아님) · 브링업&lt;br&gt;터미널 B 도 Discovery Server 에 붙음&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#d6dbe2;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=15.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2157.0" y="1803.6" width="440.0" height="159.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="records" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[저장소] records.csv&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px;font-size:13.2px;color:#3a3a3a&quot;&gt;용기 1개 = 1줄 이어쓰기 · 14칸 ts · kind · zone_id · attempts ·&lt;br&gt;rack_slot · weight_before_g · weight_after_g · leftover_rounds ·&lt;br&gt;seat_offset_mm · wipe_duration_s · force_log_path · result ·&lt;br&gt;code · duration_s · 실행한 자리 기준 · 닦기 힘 로그 logs/f3/force_*.csv&lt;br&gt;경로가 force_log_path 칸에&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#eaf3ff;strokeColor=#4a78b0;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=15.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2157.0" y="1984.7" width="440.0" height="124.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rg2drv" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[이미 있는 노드] OnRobot RG2 드라이버 —&lt;br&gt;OnRobotRGControllerServer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px;font-size:13.2px;color:#3a3a3a&quot;&gt;onrobot_rg_control · 같은 bringup 으로 뜸 · 서비스&lt;br&gt;/onrobot/sendCommand(SetCommand) · 토픽&lt;br&gt;/onrobot_joint_states(JointState · 50 Hz — 컴퓨트박스에서 읽은 폭을&lt;br&gt;관절각으로 바꿔 냄) · 컴퓨트박스와 Modbus TCP 포트 502&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#d6dbe2;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=15.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2157.0" y="2127.3" width="440.0" height="127.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ctrl" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[장치] 두산 제어기 + M0609 팔&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px;font-size:13.2px;color:#3a3a3a&quot;&gt;로봇 PC 와 유선(스위치) · Dart Platform 2.12.1 · 제어 연결을 1개만&lt;br&gt;받음(티치펜던트 제어 연결을 끊고 mode:=real) · 툴 Tool Weight 1.440 kg ·&lt;br&gt;TCP GripperDA_v1(Z 208 mm) · 비상 정지는 E-Stop&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=15.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1422.0" y="2605.1" width="470.0" height="91.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rg2dev" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[장치] OnRobot RG2 그리퍼 + 컴퓨트박스&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px;font-size:13.2px;color:#3a3a3a&quot;&gt;로봇 PC 와 유선(스위치) · Modbus TCP 포트 502 · 드라이버에서&lt;br&gt;폭 · 힘 명령을 받고, 지금 폭 · 상태를 드라이버에 줌&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=15.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="952.0" y="2605.1" width="400.0" height="75.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note_real" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[실행 방법] 실기 — PC 2대&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px;font-size:13.2px;color:#3a3a3a&quot;&gt;로봇 PC: 터미널 A Discovery Server → 터미널 B 브링업(두산 · RG2 드라이버, mode:=real) → 터미널 C ros2 launch prewash_bringup&lt;br&gt;prewash.launch.py(flow_node 1개 · hmi:=true 안 씀) / 웹 PC: ros2 run f4_hmi hmi_bridge → 브라우저 · 끄는 순서는 화면 서버 → C → B → A&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#f7f9fc;strokeColor=#8a96a3;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=15.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="2746.7" width="900.0" height="75.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note_mock" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[실행 방법] 로봇 없이 실행 — prewash_mock.launch.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:5px;font-size:13.2px;color:#3a3a3a&quot;&gt;PC 한 대에서 flow_node(use_mock=&#x27;f1,f2,f3&#x27; → robot=False) + hmi_bridge 를 같이 띄움 · 브링업 필요 없음 · 두산 노드 · 문지기 · 케이블 점검 ·&lt;br&gt;/flow/weigh 없음 · ROS_AUTOMATIC_DISCOVERY_RANGE=LOCALHOST&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#f7f9fc;strokeColor=#8a96a3;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=15.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960.0" y="2746.7" width="900.0" height="75.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#5d6976;strokeWidth=2.2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="702.0" y="521.0" width="1262.0" height="747.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.head" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fde9d9;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="703.0" y="522.0" width="1260.0" height="59.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.badge" value="&lt;b&gt;프로그램&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#333333;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=15.3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="714.0" y="537.0" width="74.0" height="26.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.title" value="&lt;b&gt;hmi_bridge — 화면 서버 (ROS 2 ↔ 웹)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=20.1;whiteSpace=nowrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800.0" y="535.0" width="362.0" height="30.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.meta" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;패키지 f4_hmi · 실행 ros2 run f4_hmi hmi_bridge&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1e3a6e&quot;&gt;프로세스 1개 = rclpy 노드 hmi_bridge + 웹 서버 uvicorn(FastAPI · 포트 8000)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=right;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=13.2;fontColor=#333333;whiteSpace=nowrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1475.3" y="530.0" width="474.7" height="39.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.col10" value="&lt;b&gt;입력 — 받는 것&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#eef0f3;strokeColor=none;fontSize=13.9;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="712.0" y="586.0" width="260.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.col342" value="&lt;b&gt;처리 — 하는 일(번호 순)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#eef0f3;strokeColor=none;fontSize=13.9;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1044.0" y="586.0" width="560.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.col962" value="&lt;b&gt;출력 — 내보내는 것&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#eef0f3;strokeColor=none;fontSize=13.9;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1664.0" y="586.0" width="290.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.grp0" value="&lt;b&gt;스레드 hmi_ros — ROS 콜백 쪽 (RosLink · StateStore · Recorder)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=9;spacingTop=3;fontSize=13.9;fontColor=#4a5666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1037.0" y="615.0" width="574.0" height="365.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.grp1" value="&lt;b&gt;웹 서버 uvicorn — FastAPI 앱 · Hub (asyncio 루프 + 작업 스레드)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=9;spacingTop=3;fontSize=13.9;fontColor=#4a5666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1037.0" y="992.1" width="574.0" height="254.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.in0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;HTTP 요청 ← 브라우저&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:3px;font-size:13.2px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;POST /api/start · stop · resume ·&lt;br&gt;abort · POST /api/replace/{item} · GET&lt;br&gt;/api/state · usage · kpi · db/{table} ·&lt;br&gt;history · 페이지 / · WebSocket 연결&lt;br&gt;/ws/state&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=14.6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="712.0" y="615.0" width="260.0" height="117.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.in1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;설정 cell.yaml · params.yaml (웹&lt;br&gt;PC 사본)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:3px;font-size:13.2px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;cobot_common.config.load()(import) ·&lt;br&gt;hmi 절 — 포트 8000 · disconnect_after_s&lt;br&gt;2.0 · service_timeout_s 1.0 · db_path&lt;br&gt;prewash.db · waste_bin_limit_g&lt;br&gt;50000 · flow.plan · rack_order ·&lt;br&gt;consumables · policy&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=14.6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="712.0" y="742.7" width="260.0" height="152.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.in2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;/flow/state (토픽 구독)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:3px;font-size:13.2px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;cobot_msgs/FlowState · depth 10&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=14.6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="712.0" y="935.1" width="260.0" height="51.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.in3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;/flow/event (토픽 구독)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:3px;font-size:13.2px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;cobot_msgs/FlowEvent · depth 50&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=14.6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="712.0" y="996.8" width="260.0" height="51.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.in4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;/flow/weigh (토픽 구독)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:3px;font-size:13.2px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;cobot_msgs/WeighLive · depth 50&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=14.6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="712.0" y="1058.6" width="260.0" height="51.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.in5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;prewash.db 읽기&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:3px;font-size:13.2px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;켤 때 최근 이벤트 50건 → ② · 잔반통&lt;br&gt;누적(usage) → ④ · usage → ⑤ 첫&lt;br&gt;메시지 · kpi · 표 조회 · 이력 → ⑥&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=14.6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="712.0" y="1120.3" width="260.0" height="84.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.out0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;WebSocket /ws/state → 브라우저&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:3px;font-size:13.2px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;type state · event · weigh · conn — 처음&lt;br&gt;1번은 전체&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=14.6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1664.0" y="615.0" width="290.0" height="68.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.out1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;HTTP 답 → 브라우저&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:3px;font-size:13.2px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;JSON {ok, message, latency_ms} · 상태 ·&lt;br&gt;usage · kpi · 이력 · 웹 페이지 파일&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=14.6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1664.0" y="693.2" width="290.0" height="68.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.out2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;prewash.db 쓰기 (SQLite)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:3px;font-size:13.2px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;events · runs · pauses · commands ·&lt;br&gt;replacements&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=14.6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1664.0" y="771.4" width="290.0" height="68.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.out3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;/flow/start · stop · resume · abort&lt;br&gt;(서비스 부름) → flow_node&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:3px;font-size:13.2px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;std_srvs/Trigger · 버튼 4개 + 잔반통 자동 정지&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=14.6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1664.0" y="849.6" width="290.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.st0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;① RosLink: 구독 3개 → StateStore(stamp 는 초로) · 서비스 클라이언트 4개 /flow/* —&lt;br&gt;call(name): 준비 안 됐으면 바로 실패 · 1.0 s 안에 답이 없으면 &#x27;flow 응답 없음&#x27; ·&lt;br&gt;/cell/force · /cell/gripping 구독은 코드에 남았지만 실제 운전에서는 발행하는 노드가&lt;br&gt;없음(개발용 fake_state_pub 만 냄)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=13.9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1044.0" y="641.0" width="560.0" height="83.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.st1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;② StateStore(락 1개): 마지막 FlowState · 최근 이벤트 50건 · 무게 표본(0.1 g) · 끊김&lt;br&gt;판정(/flow/state 가 2.0 s 넘게 없으면) · 멈추기 직전 단계 · 회차 누적 → 듣는 쪽에&lt;br&gt;알림(Recorder 먼저, Hub 다음)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=13.9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1044.0" y="734.4" width="560.0" height="66.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.st2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;③ Recorder → HmiDb: step 이 바뀔 때 — 대기 → 작업 start_run · PAUSED 들어감&lt;br&gt;open_pause(원인 갈래) · 나옴 close_pause(resume · abort · nudge · restart) ·&lt;br&gt;DONE 또는 작업 → IDLE(DONE 없이 끝남)이면 end_run / /flow/event 1건 → events&lt;br&gt;1줄(+ 버린 잔반 waste_g)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=13.9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1044.0" y="810.5" width="560.0" height="83.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.st3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;④ 잔반통 한도: 마지막 교체 뒤 버린 잔반 합이 50 000 g 이상이면 스레드 waste-stop 이&lt;br&gt;RosLink.call(&#x27;stop&#x27;) 으로 /flow/stop 을 스스로 부름(한 번만) → commands 에 &#x27;[잔반통&lt;br&gt;가득]&#x27; 으로 적음&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=13.9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1044.0" y="904.0" width="560.0" height="66.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.st4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;⑤ Hub + WebSocket /ws/state: 브라우저마다 큐 1개(200개) · 스레드를 건너는 곳은&lt;br&gt;여기 하나 · 붙자마자 전체 1번(state + plan · events · usage) → 그 뒤 state · event ·&lt;br&gt;weigh · 0.5 s 마다 연결이 바뀌면 conn&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=13.9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1044.0" y="1018.1" width="560.0" height="66.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hmi_bridge.st5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;⑥ REST: POST /api/start · stop · resume · abort → press() →&lt;br&gt;RosLink.call(name) → {ok, message, latency_ms} 를 commands 표에 적음 · POST&lt;br&gt;/api/replace/{item} → replacements · GET /api/state · usage · kpi · db/{table} ·&lt;br&gt;history&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=13.9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1044.0" y="1094.1" width="560.0" height="83.4" as="geometry