xCell id="pn325l" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;N : 1&lt;br&gt;(논리)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=13.9;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1e6b2e;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3645.0" y="1676.5" width="52.1" height="38.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pn326" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#1e6b2e;strokeWidth=2.0;startArrow=ERmany;startFill=0;endArrow=ERmandOne;endFill=0;startSize=14;endSize=14;exitX=0.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pn188" target="pn148"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="2817.0" y="2009.4"/><mxPoint x="2817.0" y="1671.2"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="pn326l" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;N : 1&lt;br&gt;(논리)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=13.9;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1e6b2e;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2772.9" y="1820.3" width="52.1" height="38.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pn327" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;관계선 = run_id 가 runs.id 를 가리킴(코드가 잇는 논리 관계 · SQL 외래 키 없음) · PK 는 모두 id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY · FK · UNIQUE · CHECK · INDEX 없음 · 시각 칸은 TEXT(웹 PC 로컬 시각 · 초) · replacements → events 는 시각으로만 이음(항목별 마지막 교체 뒤 events 로&lt;br&gt;사용량 계산: 수세미 = BOWL DONE · 솔 = CUP DONE · 세제 = DONE · 잔반통 = waste_g 합) · commands 는 다른 표와 잇는 칸 없음&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;fontSize=13.9;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2787.0" y="2441.8" width="1656.9" height="38.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>